{"seq":1,"slug":"incentive-policy-taxonomy-rule-model","title":"激励政策分类与可计算规则模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/incentive-policy-taxonomy-rule-model","wordCount":2931,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"激励政策分类与可计算规则模型\">激励政策分类与可计算规则模型</h1><p>一家在新加坡注册的控股公司向某自贸港工业区提交投资登记，同一笔设备投资可能同时触发三类优惠：企业所得税按 15% 优惠税率计征、进口设备关税与进口环节增值税豁免、地方按投资额给予租金减免。三项优惠各有独立的资格谓词与计量口径，任何一项判定写错，退回的不是&quot;少拿一点优惠&quot;，而是整份投资登记被要求补正重报。把三类优惠塞进同一个&quot;优惠标记&quot;字段，是激励系统最常见的原始设计错误。</p>\n<p>本文处理<strong>资格认定与计算引擎的输入层</strong>：一条激励政策如何从法律文本被拆解成机器可判定、可计量、可审计的规则对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-激励是-谓词-计量函数-约束-的可判定组合\">核心概念：激励是&quot;谓词 + 计量函数 + 约束&quot;的可判定组合</h2><p>一条激励政策不是一句描述，而是一个六元组：触发条件、资格谓词集、计量函数、约束集、期限窗口、回收条款。任何一项缺失，规则都无法完整执行——缺资格谓词会超范围发放，缺计量函数会退化成人工估算，缺回收条款则事后无从追缴。</p>\n<p>激励的财政性质决定了它必须被当作价值让渡来建模。WTO《补贴与反补贴措施协定》第 1.1 条把补贴定义为&quot;政府的财政资助&quot;或&quot;任何形式的收入或价格支持&quot;，且&quot;由此授予了利益&quot;；财政资助明确包括&quot;政府本应征收的收入被放弃或未予征收&quot;，税收抵免即属此列（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/24-scm_01_e.htm\">WTO SCM Agreement 第 1 条</a>）。因此税率式与抵免式优惠与现金补助同类，必须共用同一套强度约束与叠加规则。| 构成要素 | 在规则中的角色 | 缺失后的典型故障 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 触发条件 | 什么行为进入评估（新设、增资、扩产、采购） | 规则永不触发，或对存量投资误触发 |\n| 资格谓词集 | 主体、行业、地域、规模、实质运营的组合布尔条件 | 超范围发放，事后审计无法收回 |\n| 计量函数 | 从合格基数额到优惠金额的映射 | 退化为人工估算，口径不可复现 |\n| 约束集 | 强度上限、叠加规则、去最小化门槛 | 多项优惠叠加后突破法定上限 |\n| 期限窗口 | 生效日与失效日的判定基准 | 跨期投资被错误归入或排除 |\n| 回收条款 | 条件不再满足时的追缴触发 | 优惠已落袋，无追缴依据 |</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[激励政策文本] --&gt; B[触发条件&lt;br/&gt;投资行为识别]&#10;  B --&gt; C[资格谓词集&lt;br/&gt;主体/行业/地域/规模/实质运营]&#10;  C --&gt; D{全部谓词为真?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[结构化拒绝码&lt;br/&gt;附未满足谓词清单]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[计量函数&lt;br/&gt;基数额 × 优惠率/额度]&#10;  F --&gt; G[约束集&lt;br/&gt;强度上限 · 叠加 · 去最小化]&#10;  G --&gt; H[生成可执行优惠行&lt;br/&gt;附规则版本与证据快照]&#10;  H --&gt; I[期限窗口与回收条款&lt;br/&gt;持续监控]\">graph TD\n  A[激励政策文本] --&gt; B[触发条件&lt;br/&gt;投资行为识别]\n  B --&gt; C[资格谓词集&lt;br/&gt;主体/行业/地域/规模/实质运营]\n  C --&gt; D{全部谓词为真?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[结构化拒绝码&lt;br/&gt;附未满足谓词清单]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[计量函数&lt;br/&gt;基数额 × 优惠率/额度]\n  F --&gt; G[约束集&lt;br/&gt;强度上限 · 叠加 · 去最小化]\n  G --&gt; H[生成可执行优惠行&lt;br/&gt;附规则版本与证据快照]\n  H --&gt; I[期限窗口与回收条款&lt;br/&gt;持续监控]</pre><h2 id=\"激励工具的类型学-五类工具与各自的计量口径\">激励工具的类型学：五类工具与各自的计量口径</h2><p>把优惠笼统称为&quot;税收优惠&quot;会掩盖一个事实：不同工具作用于计税链条的不同位置，计量口径因此完全不同。税率式作用于计算率，扣减式作用于税基，抵免式作用于税额本身，补贴式独立于税制之外。<strong>工具类别决定资格认定的对象</strong>——对税率式，监管关心主体与行业属性；对抵免式，关心合格投资支出的证明。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具类别</th>\n<th>典型形态</th>\n<th>计量口径</th>\n<th>常见判定难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>税率式</td>\n<td>优惠企业所得税率、免税期</td>\n<td>直接改变适用税率</td>\n<td>优惠期起算点（获利年度 vs 登记年度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扣减/加速式</td>\n<td>加速折旧、加计扣除、投资扣除</td>\n<td>作用于税基的现值</td>\n<td>资产分类与折旧年限的映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抵免式</td>\n<td>投资抵免、研发抵免</td>\n<td>抵减应纳税额</td>\n<td>可退与不可退、结转年限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补贴式</td>\n<td>现金补助、贷款贴息、用工补贴</td>\n<td>直接金额</td>\n<td>与税式优惠的重复计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非税式</td>\n<td>关税豁免、土地租金、外汇便利</td>\n<td>边境或要素成本</td>\n<td>与非优惠基准情景的差额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以优惠税率与投资抵免的叠加为例，优惠后的应纳所得税额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>I</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>pref</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>κ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\big(\\pi - A - \\alpha I\\big)\\cdot r_{\\text{pref}} - C\\right),\\qquad C = \\min\\!\\left(\\beta I,\\; \\kappa \\cdot T_{\\text{gross}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 为应纳税所得额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为加速折旧等税基扣减，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 为合格投资支出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>pref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{pref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为优惠税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为抵免额。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 正是&quot;不可退抵免&quot;的数学表达：抵免以当期应纳税额为天花板，超出部分按规则结转或作废，而非退还。海南自由贸易港的企业所得税优惠是税率式的典型样本——对注册并实际运营在海南、且属鼓励类产业的企业按 15% 计征（标准税率 25%），同时对高端紧缺人才个人所得税超过 15% 的部分予以免征，该人才政策延续至 2027 年（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hainan_Free_Trade_Port\">Hainan Free Trade Port 概览</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可计算表示-条件-计量-约束的三段式\">可计算表示：条件→计量→约束的三段式</h2><p>规则引擎选型（规则语言 vs 决策表 vs 硬编码）有一条分界：<strong>会随政策文本同步变动的部分必须外置为数据，不会变的部分才写进代码</strong>。鼓励类产业目录、优惠率、强度上限、期限窗口每年都变；而&quot;谓词求值顺序&quot;&quot;证据快照结构&quot;&quot;拒绝码枚举&quot;是稳定的工程契约。前者硬编码进服务会导致每次目录更新都要发版，后者做成可配置则让系统失去可审计性。一个可直接落库的规则对象大致如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;cit-pref-15-encouraged&quot;,&#10;  &quot;instrument&quot;: &quot;rate_based&quot;,&#10;  &quot;trigger&quot;: { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;new_establishment_or_capex&quot; },&#10;  &quot;predicates&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;industry_code&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in&quot;, &quot;value_from&quot;: &quot;encouraged_catalog&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;registration_region&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;eq&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;HNFTP&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;substantive_operation&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;satisfies&quot;, &quot;value_from&quot;: &quot;substance_test_v3&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;amount&quot;: { &quot;fn&quot;: &quot;reduce_rate&quot;, &quot;base&quot;: &quot;taxable_profit&quot;, &quot;rate&quot;: 0.15 },&#10;  &quot;constraints&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;aid_intensity_ceiling&quot;, &quot;max&quot;: &quot;regional_ceiling&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;cumulation&quot;, &quot;group&quot;: &quot;cit_rate&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;exclusive&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;window&quot;: { &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2020-01-01&quot;, &quot;effective_to&quot;: &quot;2027-12-31&quot; },&#10;  &quot;clawback&quot;: { &quot;on&quot;: &quot;substance_test_fail&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;recover_with_interest&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cit-pref-15-encouraged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"instrument\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rate_based\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new_establishment_or_capex\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"predicates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"industry_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"encouraged_catalog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"registration_region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HNFTP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"substantive_operation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"satisfies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"substance_test_v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reduce_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"taxable_profit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aid_intensity_ceiling\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regional_ceiling\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cumulation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cit_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"exclusive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2020-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effective_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-12-31\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"clawback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"substance_test_fail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recover_with_interest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>求值顺序不可交换：<strong>先求谓词，再算金额，最后套约束</strong>。若先算金额，被约束削减的部分仍会出现在中间结果里，一旦上游误用未裁剪的金额，就会产生账面与申报的长期不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资格认定-客观自动判定-vs-酌定裁量\">资格认定：客观自动判定 vs 酌定裁量</h2><p>资格谓词的&quot;可判定性&quot;直接决定条款的合法性风险与工程复杂度。WTO 规则给出三条互斥路径：法律或授权机关&quot;明确将补贴获得限于特定企业&quot;构成法律上的专向性；若资格与金额由<strong>客观标准或条件</strong>规定，且资格自动取得、规则被严格遵守、标准可核验地载明于法律或官方文件，则不构成专向性；即便表面非专向，也可因有限数量企业使用、被特定企业不成比例地大量使用、或授权机关行使裁量权而构成事实专向性（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/24-scm_01_e.htm\">WTO SCM Agreement 第 2 条</a>）。<strong>第 2.1(b) 条的&quot;客观标准 + 自动取得&quot;正是可计算规则模型的合法性来源</strong>：能被写成谓词的条件，最不容易被认定为裁量性专向。</p>\n<p>强制要求&quot;实质运营&quot;是另一类高频谓词，它把主体属性判定扩展为持续性事实判定，典型谓词含实际管理机构在区域内、雇员与社保、资产在当地、收入与区域实质关联。难点不在求值，而在<strong>证据的时效性与可留存性</strong>——资格不是一次性授予，而需在优惠期内周期复核。欧洲的路径是把&quot;自动取得&quot;制度化：符合《通用集体豁免条例》（GBER, Reg. (EU) No 651/2014）的区域投资援助无须事前通报，约 96% 的国家援助在该条例下授予（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_aid_(European_Union)\">EU State aid 概览</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"政策叠加-强度上限与反规避\">政策叠加、强度上限与反规避</h2><p>单一激励的合规性不保证组合后的合规性。叠加分三层：同一税种内、跨税种（税式与关税）、税式优惠与现金补贴。第一层的典型解法是<strong>强度上限</strong>——把优惠折算为对合格投资成本的净现值比率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>NPV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>benefit</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>NPV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>eligible cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{total}} = \\sum_{i \\in S} \\frac{\\text{NPV}(\\text{benefit}_i)}{\\text{NPV}(\\text{eligible cost})},\\qquad g_{\\text{total}} \\le \\bar{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7487em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NPV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eligible cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NPV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">benefit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>欧盟区域投资援助框架即此结构的代表：GBER 第 14 条按区域类别设定最高援助强度，并对中小企业上浮（小型企业加 20 个百分点、中型企业加 10 个百分点），超过通报门槛必须事前通报（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/651/oj/eng\">Reg. (EU) No 651/2014 第 14 条</a>）。小额援助另走&quot;去最小化（de minimis）&quot;通道。</p>\n<p>第二层反规避针对<strong>优惠与税基的人为错配</strong>。全球最低税（Pillar Two）给强度上限引入新的外部约束：对年收入达门槛的跨国集团，若某辖区有效税率低于 15%，母国或其他辖区可征收补足税（QDMTT），使当地低税率优惠被上游回收：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Top-up</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>GloBE</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mtext>Excess Profit</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Excess Profit</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>GloBE</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>SBIE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Top-up} = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; 15\\% - r_{\\text{GloBE}}\\right)\\times \\text{Excess Profit},\\qquad \\text{Excess Profit} = \\pi_{\\text{GloBE}} - \\text{SBIE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Top-up</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">GloBE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Excess Profit</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Excess Profit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">GloBE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SBIE</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 SBIE 为&quot;实质性所得排除&quot;，由合格工资与有形资产按逐年递减的过渡系数计算。Pillar Two 落地时间表各法域不一：欧盟多数成员国、英国等自 2023 年 12 月 31 日起适用，澳大利亚、韩国等自 2024 年 1 月 1 日起适用，马来西亚、新加坡、泰国自 2025 年 1 月 1 日起适用；2026 年 1 月各方还达成一项安排，美国总部企业仅适用美国最低税而豁免于 Pillar Two（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_minimum_corporate_tax_rate\">Global minimum corporate tax rate</a>）。对园区激励系统的直接后果是：<strong>优惠的&quot;账面价值&quot;与&quot;实际到手价值&quot;分离</strong>，规则模型必须把补足税视为下游扣除项，否则净收益测算会系统性高估。</p>\n<p>第三层是时序反规避：多数法域设有&quot;不得在区域内关闭同类活动&quot;的排除条款，防止企业把既有产能迁入园区套取优惠。这类条件是跨实体、跨时间的关联谓词，最容易被实现遗漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则版本治理与可审计性\">规则版本治理与可审计性</h2><p>激励规则的可诉性决定了它必须按&quot;版本化的证据契约&quot;管理。<strong>规则版本与事实快照同时入档</strong>：判定发生时用的是哪一版谓词、哪一版目录、哪些事实输入，三者缺一，事后无法复现结论。<strong>生效日与追溯分离</strong>：系统须以业务发生时间为归属基准，而非录入时间。<strong>拒绝理由结构化</strong>：给申请人笼统的失败结果是运维灾难，正确做法是返回未满足的谓词清单与补正指引。</p>\n<p>这三点服务于一个目的——让法务不依赖工程师独立维护目录与阈值，而工程师专注于谓词求值、证据快照与拒绝码枚举这些稳定的工程契约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>激励政策在系统里是六元组：触发条件、资格谓词集、计量函数、约束集、期限窗口、回收条款；缺一不可。</li>\n<li>五类工具（税率式、扣减式、抵免式、补贴式、非税式）作用于计税链条的不同位置，资格认定对象随之不同。</li>\n<li>规则求值顺序是&quot;先谓词、再金额、后约束&quot;；叠加模式决定多项优惠能否共存。</li>\n<li>可写成封闭客观谓词的条款最不容易被认定为专向性补贴（WTO SCM 第 2.1(b) 条），这是把政策转成规则模型的合规价值所在。</li>\n<li>强度上限（含 SME 上浮、去最小化门槛）与全球最低税补足税共同压缩优惠净价值，规则模型必须把两者作为下游扣除项建模。</li>\n<li>规则版本与证据快照必须同时入档，拒绝理由必须结构化，否则判定结果不可复现、不可申诉。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"激励政策分类与可计算规则模型","id":"激励政策分类与可计算规则模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：激励是\"谓词 + 计量函数 + 约束\"的可判定组合","id":"核心概念-激励是-谓词-计量函数-约束-的可判定组合"},{"level":2,"text":"激励工具的类型学：五类工具与各自的计量口径","id":"激励工具的类型学-五类工具与各自的计量口径"},{"level":2,"text":"可计算表示：条件→计量→约束的三段式","id":"可计算表示-条件-计量-约束的三段式"},{"level":2,"text":"资格认定：客观自动判定 vs 酌定裁量","id":"资格认定-客观自动判定-vs-酌定裁量"},{"level":2,"text":"政策叠加、强度上限与反规避","id":"政策叠加-强度上限与反规避"},{"level":2,"text":"规则版本治理与可审计性","id":"规则版本治理与可审计性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"投资者资质审查与实益所有人穿透识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/zone-regime-investor-admission-model/investor-qualification-beneficial-owner-review"},"next":{"title":"激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/eligibility-calculation-engine"}}